  (descr "noknok PicoHub mezzanine contact pads, interface rev 2 (22 Sep 2026), cluster D (6 flat round pads D2.4 mm, 3.5 mm pitch, copper + mask only - NO paste, ENIG; the spring pins live on the mezzanine): USB port on pads: USB_DP, USB_DM, GND / MEZZ_5V, MEZZ_PRESENT, MEZZ_FAULT (PRESENT low = I take the USB uplink). ORIGIN = mounting hole H4 of the 60x40 MOD-0008 pattern: place on the hub BOTTOM exactly on H4, rotation 0 (authored with y negated so the flip puts every pad at its viewed-from-above position). Mates with noknok_Mezzanine_D_PogoPins_BWCD.")
